    <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;text-align:center;text-indent:0pt;"><b><u>LOAN AND SECURITY AGREEMENT</u></b>
